   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Ministerstvo zahrani&#x10d;n&#xfd;ch vec&#xed; a eur&#xf3;pskych z&#xe1;le&#x17e;itost&#xed; SR</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ministry of Foreign and European Affairs of the Slovak Republic</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rehabilitation Centre for Children of the War in Kyiv</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Rehabilitation Centre for Children of the War in Kyiv</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Projekt je zameran&#xfd; na vytvorenie rehabilita&#x10d;n&#xe9;ho centra pre deti zasiahnut&#xe9; vojnou, v ktorom im bude poskytovan&#xe1; psychologick&#xe1; pomoc a podpora. Z projektu bude financovan&#xe9; vybavenie pre tri miestnosti, v ktor&#xfd;ch bude poskytovan&#xe1; psychologick&#xe1; podpora, dvaja psychol&#xf3;govia, projektov&#xfd; mana&#x17e;&#xe9;r a koordin&#xe1;tor. &#x17d;iadate&#x13e; pl&#xe1;nuje otvorenie siete rehabilita&#x10d;n&#xfd;ch centier po celej krajine, ke&#x10f;&#x17e;e psychologick&#xe1; podpora bude potrebn&#xe1; dlhodobo.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to create a rehabilitation center for children affected by the war, where they will be provided with psychological help and support. The project will finance equipment for three rooms where psychological support will be provided, two psychologists, a project manager and a coordinator. The applicant plans to open a network of rehabilitation centers throughout the country, as psychological support will be needed in the long term.</narrative>
  </description>
